  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "free-vision-skill",
      "text": "[](LICENSE)\n[](https://www.apple.com/macos/)\n[](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/vision)\n[](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Local_computing)\n\nFully-local image understanding (OCR / table extraction / description) via macOS Vision. Images never leave your Mac."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install (DSH-Plugin)",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin add @niyongsheng/free-vision-skill\n```\n\nThen add to `cordis.patch.yml`:\n\n```yaml\n- insert:\n    - id: free-vision-skill\n      name: '@niyongsheng/free-vision-skill'\n      config:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tools",
      "text": "- `view_image` — describe image content (scene, people, QR, composition)\n- `ocr_image` — extract text; `layout=true` for table structure + coordinates\n\nInput: http(s) URL / base64 / local path."
    },
    {
      "section": "Paste-to-path (Web UI)",
      "text": "Paste (⌘V) an image in the DSH web input box → its local absolute path is\ninserted. Loopback-only upload, magic-byte checked: PNG / JPEG / GIF / WebP /\nHEIC / HEIF."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage (Claude Code Skill)",
      "text": "```bash\nswift scripts/ocr.swift image.png          # OCR\nswift scripts/ocr.swift --layout image.png # table + coordinates\nswift scripts/ocr.swift --describe image.png # describe image\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Notes",
      "text": "- Requires macOS 11+ & Xcode Command Line Tools\n- First run compiles ~5–10s, cached afterwards"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE) © 2026 Nico"
    }
